[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_7p0ow"]
script = ExtResource("1_hhe5i")
texto = "Using the \"arena\" function starts a run. If your HP drops to 0, you lose all resources gathered during that run.

To survive the run and escape, click the button \"STOP AND ESCAPE\"[req=Automação 1]. It's also possible to escape the match using a function \"escapar()\"[/req]."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dg4eb1rd0eaip"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_pws7u"]
script = ExtResource("1_hhe5i")
tipo = 2
texto = "Leveling up"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dg4eb1rd0eaip"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_f5o1o"]
script = ExtResource("1_hhe5i")
texto = "
In each run, you start at Level 1. As you gather resources, your EXP bar fills up. When it's full, you level up.
The max level you can reach is Level 10.

Each level grants about +10% Agility. At max level, you get a 100% bonus, meaning your base Agility is doubled."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dg4eb1rd0eaip"

